        "entry_height": 170,
        "entry_fmt": 3,
        "end_offsets_are_inclusive_and_cumulative": true,
        "no_leftover_bytes": true
      },
      "note": "Each blob covers exactly FRAME_PIXELS pixels (_walk_rle_frame, lines 216-226). End offsets depend on blob sizes, so they are checked by walking the payload, not stated."
